$(1)$ Simplify $\frac{2}{{\sqrt{5}+\sqrt{3}}}$ using the above method; 

$(2)$ Calculate: $({\frac{1}{{\sqrt{2}+1}}+\frac{1}{{\sqrt{3}+\sqrt{2}}}+\frac{1}{{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{3}}}+\ldots+\frac{1}{{\sqrt{2023}+\sqrt{2022}}}})×({\sqrt{2023}+1})$.

