(5) For real numbers, $x > y$ is a necessary and sufficient condition for $\frac{1}{x} < \frac{1}{y}$ to hold;  
(6) Given simple propositions $p$ and $q$, if “$p \lor q$” is false, then “$\neg p \lor \neg q$” is also false.

